  "releaseNotes": "Fixes a spec-conformance bug: a request with neither Content-Length nor Transfer-Encoding is now correctly treated as having no body (RFC 9112 6.3 rule 6) instead of being read as close-delimited. Previously such requests never completed until EOF was signalled, and following pipelined requests could be swallowed as body data. See README version history.",
